BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco Fleet Week 2026: Ship Tours\, Blue Angels Air Show +
  Full Schedule of Events (Oct. 4-12)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1549516@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSan Francisco Fleet Week 2026:
  Air Show + Schedule of EventsLook up in the sky when you hear the roaring
  of jet engines and head down to SF’s northern waterfront for San Franci
 sco’s annual Fleet Week air show and festival.\nSan Francisco Fleet Week
  returns October 4-12\, 2026\, bringing more than a full week of military 
 bands\, ship tours\, the Parade of Ships\, community events\, and the big 
 aerial spectacle over San Francisco Bay. The centerpiece is the Fleet Week
  Air Show\, October 9-11\, 2026\, with the U.S. Navy Blue Angels headlinin
 g the show between the Golden Gate Bridge and Alcatraz.\n\nThe air show is
  presented by United and features the Blue Angels\, United Airlines 777\, 
 U.S. Air Force F-22 Raptor Demo Team\, U.S. Air Force Heritage Flight\, U.
 S. Marine Corps F-35B Demo Team\, U.S. Coast Guard aircraft\, U.S. Navy E-
 6B Mercury\, U.S. Air Force C-130 Hercules\, U-2 Dragon Lady and C-5 Super
  Galaxy flybys\, and T-6 Texan IIs. The United 777 is billed as the only c
 ommercial airliner performing a fully choreographed act at a U.S. air show
 .\nSan Francisco Fleet Week 2026\nFull Festival: October 4-12\, 2026\nAir 
 Show: October 9-11\, 2026\, 12-4 PM\n2026 Fleet Week Event Map\nSan Franci
 sco Waterfront\nFREE\nSee full air show schedule\n2026 Fleet Week Schedule
 \nAir Show\nFriday\, Saturday & Sunday\, October 9-11\, 2026 | 12-4 PM | S
 an Francisco Waterfront\n– Thursday afternoon: Each year there are typic
 ally Blue Angels “test flights” on Thursday.\nAlthough it’s not the 
 full airs...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://fleetweeksf.org/\nDetails: https:
 //sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-fleet-week-2025-ship-tours-blue-angels-air
 -show-full-schedule-of-events-oct-5-13/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Home-P
 age-Ticker-3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:All Over San Francisco\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-fleet-week-2025-ship-tours-blue-
 angels-air-show-full-schedule-of-events-oct-5-13/
END:VEVENT
