DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1636997@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:SF Fire Credit UnionKick off Fleet Week in Noe Valley with SF 
 Fire Credit Union as we celebrate our 75th anniversary. Join us for a spec
 ial ribbon cutting at our Noe Valley Branch\, followed by live music from 
 the 1st Marine Division Brass Band in the Noe Valley Town Square.\nThe eve
 nt is free and open to the community. RSVP today to be automatically enter
 ed to win a $750 Term Certificate (with term of your choice). Winner will 
 be announced at the event so you must be present to win.\n\nFree\n\nTicket
 s: https://sffirecu.org/75years\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-fire-
 credit-union-75th-anniversary-celebration/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/image-
 1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:SF Fire Credit Union Noe Valley Branch / Noe Valley Town Square\,
  3908 24th St\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-fire-credit-union-75th-anniversary-celebrat
 ion/
END:VEVENT
