BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flyby Social: Fleet Week Blue Angel Rooftop Mixer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639109@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerOctober in San Francisco is al
 ive with energy. Fleet Week brings the Blue Angels overhead\, and the city
 ’s pulse quickens with anticipation. Amid the bustle\, the San Francisco
  Chamber of Commerce invites you to step above the noise and connect with 
 the people shaping the future of our local economy.\nA chance to step away
  from the desk and connect with the SF business community over elevated\, 
 rooftop views!\n\nFlyby Social is a midday rooftop networking mixer with r
 efreshments\, tastes of Chotto Matte’s Nikkei cuisine blending fresh Per
 uvian ingredients and refined Japanese culinary techniques\, and thoughtfu
 l conversations with professionals who share appreciation for the city we 
 call home. Space is limited — register today to secure your place and ex
 pand your network.\n\nLocation: Chotto Matte Rooftop\nTime: 1:00 PM – 4:
 00 PM\nTickets: $15 for Members | $25 for Non-Members (Young Professional 
 pricing available)\n\nSponsored by\n\nAs the Chamber continues its role as
  a convener of business and community\, we welcome you to join us in a spa
 ce where relationships are built with intention. Co-hosted with Chotto Mat
 te\, the premier Japanese – Peruvian (Nikkei) cuisine and restaurant exp
 erience with great rooftop views of San Francisco cityscape.\n\n$25.00\n\n
 Tickets: https://business.sfchamber.com/events/details/flyby-social-fleet-
 week-blue-angel-rooftop-mixer-2026-13198?utm_source=sf-funcheap&amp\;utm_m
 edium=event&amp\;utm_campaign=flyby-social-2026\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/flyby-social-fleet-week-blue-angel-rooftop-mixer/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FlybyS
 ocial2026v4.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Chotto Matte Rooftop\, 50 O'Farrell Street\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4108
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/flyby-social-fleet-week-blue-angel-rooftop-mix
 er/
END:VEVENT
