DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17549660@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Downtown SF Partnership + Noise Pop Present\nFridays on Front 
 Street\nYacht Rock Block Party\nFriday\, October 9 | ​Front Street Enter
 tainment Zone\n\nRSVP FOR FREE BY 10/08 & AUTOMATICALLY BE ENTERED TO WIN 
 A PRIZE PACKAGE FEATURING CRUISE TICKETS\, SF GIANTS OFFICIAL MERCH PACKAG
 E\, GIFT CARDS & MORE!\n\nKick off Fleet Week weekend with the ultimate FR
 EE 'Yacht Rock' Block Party in Downtown San Francisco! Live music\, street
 -sipping\, & more!\n\nAll aboard\, Bay Area! We're dropping anchor on Fron
 t Street for the ultimate 2026 series finale on Friday\, October 9th (4–
 9 PM)\n\nHosted by the Downtown SF Partnership in collaboration with Noise
  Pop Industries\, join us as we set sail into the weekend with non-stop hi
 ts\, cold brews\, local bites\, and all the 70s & 80s vibes your heart des
 ires.\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n\nCatch live performances by Haulin' Oats deliver
 ing a high-energy tribute to the legendary music of Daryl Hall & John Oate
 s\, followed by headliners Wonder Bread 5 bringing a powerhouse\, party an
 them set.\nFuel the festivities with signature cocktails\, cold brews\, an
 d delicious bites available all evening long from Front Street bars Schroe
 der’s\, Harrington’s\, and The Royal Exchange.\nA shred-worthy Yacht R
 ock Lip Sync Battle\, Best Stache Contest (Homegrown & Most Creative)\, 80
 s Beauty Bar & Temp Flash Tats\, outdoor screening of Top Gun\, circus per
 formers\, a Volkswagen Bus photobooth\, fresh shucking from The Oyster Gir
 ls\, and more!\nPLUS! Free captain hats for the first 100 attendees!\nVIP 
 GIVEAWAY...\n\nFree\nDowntown SF Partnership + Noise Pop Present\n\nTicket
 s: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2
 Ffridays-on-front-st-free-yacht-rock-block-party-tickets-1999042771743%3Fa
 ff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/fridays
 -on-front-street-fleet-week-yacht-rock-block-party\nSource: DoTheBay
