DESCRIPTION:Spinsters of San Francisco is excited to partner with Real Opt
 ions for City Kids (R.O.C.K.) and Jaxson to bring you our highly anticipat
 ed Fleet or Flight Party—a Fleet Week celebration with a cause!\n\nJoin 
 us for an evening of cocktails\, community\, and giving back at one of the
  Marina's premier venues. This Fleet Week–inspired celebration features:
 \n\nSignature Cocktails from our exclusive Fleet or Flight drink menu\nLin
 e Dancing with a professional instructor\, beginners very much welcome\nRa
 ffle Prizes from some of our favorite local businesses\nFleet Week Festivi
 ties with themed décor and Fleet-or-Flight attire highly encouraged. Pick
  your side: Fleet or Flight. Sailor whites\, naval-inspired looks\, flight
  suits\, aviators\, cowboy boots and creative interpretations encouraged.\
 nProfessional Photographer to capture you and your crew looking fly\nDanci
 ng\, Drinks & More throughout the night\n\nWhat's included:\nYour ticket i
 ncludes two drink tickets from our special Fleet or Flight menu.\n\nEvent 
 proceeds support R.O.C.K. plus Jaxson will generously donate 10% of our ba
 r tab for the evening directly to R.O.C.K.\nSupporting our community:\nYou
 r participation directly benefits Real Options for City Kids (R.O.C.K.)\, 
 a San Francisco nonprofit dedicated to empowering local youth through:\n\n
 Academic enrichment and support\nOutdoor experiences and adventure program
 s\nLife skills development opportunities\nMilitary personnel: Contact Cros
 by Kelly at vp@sfspinsters.com for discount information.\nCome for t...\n\
 nSpinsters of San Francisco\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=h
 ttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2F2000074346210%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/17th-annual-fleet-or-fligh
 t-party-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funchea
 p.com/spinsters-san-franciscos-17th-annual-fleet-flight/
