UID:funcheap-1638984@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Fleet Week 2026: Air Show + Schedule of Events\n
 Navy Flight Demonstration Squadron\nLook up in the sky when you hear the r
 oaring of jet engines and head down to SF’s northern waterfront for San 
 Francisco’s annual Fleet Week air show and festival.\nSan Francisco Flee
 t Week returns October 4-12\, 2026\, bringing more than a full week of mil
 itary bands\, ship tours\, the Parade of Ships\, community events\, and th
 e big aerial spectacle over San Francisco Bay. The centerpiece is the Flee
 t Week Air Show\, October 9-11\, 2026\, with the U.S. Navy Blue Angels hea
 dlining the show between the Golden Gate Bridge and Alcatraz.\nThe air sho
 w is presented by United and features the Blue Angels\, United Airlines 77
 7\, U.S. Air Force F-22 Raptor Demo Team\, U.S. Air Force Heritage Flight\
 , U.S. Marine Corps F-35B Demo Team\, U.S. Coast Guard aircraft\, U.S. Nav
 y E-6B Mercury\, U.S. Air Force C-130 Hercules\, U-2 Dragon Lady and C-5 S
 uper Galaxy flybys\, and T-6 Texan IIs. The United 777 is billed as the on
 ly commercial airliner performing a fully choreographed act at a U.S. air 
 show.\n\nSan Francisco Fleet Week 2026\nFull Festival: October 4-12\, 2026
 \nAir Show: October 9-11\, 2026\, 12-4 PM\n2026 Fleet Week Event Map\nSan 
 Francisco Waterfront\nFREE\nSee full air show schedule\n2026 Fleet Week Sc
 hedule\nAir Show\nFriday\, Saturday & Sunday\, October 9-11\, 2026 | 12-4 
 PM | San Francisco Waterfront\n– Thursday afternoon: Each year there are
  typically Blue Angels “test flights” on Thursday.\nAlthough it’s no
 t the full...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://fleetweeksf.org/\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-fleet-week-2026-ceremonial-band-italian-heritage-pa
 rade/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Home-P
 age-Ticker-3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-fleet-week-2026-ceremonial-band-italian-he
 ritage-parade/
